1784307992.699 RX village entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade
1784307992.699 RX surrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random
1784307992.699 RX raiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path
1784307992.699 RX that leads to the west and southeast. 
