1784309038.977 RX Newhaven, Narrow Road
1784309038.977 RX     This narrow road is quite plain save for the various lanterns hanging from
1784309038.977 RX the trees around, and a large stone stairwell leading downwards. You hear the
1784309038.977 RX clash of steel below you, and cries of pain and triumph accompanying it. Stone
1784309038.977 RX buildings lie to your north and west. 
1784309038.977 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west, down
