1784309040.234 RX     This nicely crafted room is well furnished and decorated with things that
1784309040.234 RX you have never seen before, from strange exotic weapons, to swirling vials of
1784309040.234 RX liquid. A well toned man, stands in front of a practice mat with his arms
1784309040.234 RX crossed. He stands up lightly at your approach, looks you up and down, and
1784309040.234 RX breaks into a lopsided grin. 
1784309040.236 RX Also here: Corwyn.
1784309040.236 RX Obvious exits: south
